{"id": "r169-v4-code_task-00-en", "config": "grounded-v2", "reply": "```python\ndef run_length_encode(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Encode runs of identical consecutive characters.\n\n    Each run of a character is replaced by the character followed by the\n    length of that run. For example, 'aaabcc' becomes 'a3b1c2'.\n    An empty input string returns an empty string.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    s : str\n        Input string to encode.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    str\n        Run-length encoded string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = []\n    current_char = s[0]\n    count = 1\n\n    for ch in s[1:]:\n        if ch == current_char:\n            count += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n            current_char = ch\n            count = 1\n\n    result.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n    return \"\".join(result)\n```", "model": "keyless:gpt-oss-20b", "error": null, "code": "def run_length_encode(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Encode runs of identical consecutive characters.\n\n    Each run of a character is replaced by the character followed by the\n    length of that run. For example, 'aaabcc' becomes 'a3b1c2'.\n    An empty input string returns an empty string.\n\n    Parameters\n    ----------\n    s : str\n        Input string to encode.\n\n    Returns\n    -------\n    str\n        Run-length encoded string.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result = []\n    current_char = s[0]\n    count = 1\n\n    for ch in s[1:]:\n        if ch == current_char:\n            count += 1\n        else:\n            result.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n            current_char = ch\n            count = 1\n\n    result.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n    return \"\".join(result)\n", "latency_s": 27.77, "score": {"id": "r169-v4-code_task-00-en", "lang": "en", "task_type": "code_task", "split": "dev", "polarity": "positive", "expected_behavior": "pass_tests", "comple