{"id": "r169-v4-code_task-00-ar", "config": "grounded-v2", "reply": "```python\ndef run_length_encode(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the run-length encoding of the string `s`.\n    Consecutive identical characters are replaced with the character followed by the count.\n    The empty string is encoded as the empty string.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> run_length_encode(\"aaabcc\")\n    'a3b1c2'\n    >>> run_length_encode(\"\")\n    ''\n    \"\"\"\n\n    if not s:            # Handles None or empty string\n        return \"\"\n\n    encoded_parts = []\n    current_char = s[0]\n    count = 1\n\n    for ch in s[1:]:\n        if ch == current_char:\n            count += 1\n        else:\n            encoded_parts.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n            current_char = ch\n            count = 1\n\n    # append last run\n    encoded_parts.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n\n    return \"\".join(encoded_parts)\n```", "model": "keyless:gpt-oss-20b", "error": null, "code": "def run_length_encode(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Return the run-length encoding of the string `s`.\n    Consecutive identical characters are replaced with the character followed by the count.\n    The empty string is encoded as the empty string.\n\n    Examples\n    --------\n    >>> run_length_encode(\"aaabcc\")\n    'a3b1c2'\n    >>> run_length_encode(\"\")\n    ''\n    \"\"\"\n\n    if not s:            # Handles None or empty string\n        return \"\"\n\n    encoded_parts = []\n    current_char = s[0]\n    count = 1\n\n    for ch in s[1:]:\n        if ch == current_char:\n            count += 1\n        else:\n            encoded_parts.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n            current_char = ch\n            count = 1\n\n    # append last run\n    encoded_parts.append(f\"{current_char}{count}\")\n\n    return \"\".join(encoded_parts)\n", "latency_s": 30.57, "score": {"id": "r169-v4-code_task-00-ar", "lang": "ar", "task_type": "code_task", "split": "dev", "polarit